~ WARDROBE AI ~

Ever stared at your closet and thought you have nothing to wear?
The Wardrobe AI agent is developed specifically to help you uncover your best fashion combos so that you never have to stress about your outfits again!

Prerequisites:

Java, Docker (with elasticsearch container installed), Python, Postman

Setup:

1. Run the Elasticsearch container in Docker

2. Initialise the wardrobe index in Kibana Elasticsearch (localhost:5601):
    a. Create index “wardrobe” with settings and mappings

PUT /wardrobe
{
  "settings": {
    "index": {
      "number_of_shards": 1,
      "number_of_replicas": 0
    }
  },
  "mappings": {
    "properties": {
      "item_name": { "type": "text" },
      "category": { "type": "keyword" },
      "description": { 
        "type": "text",
        "fields": {
          "keyword": { "type": "keyword", "ignore_above": 256 }
        }
      },
      "description_vector": { 
        "type": "dense_vector", 
        "dims": 1536, 
        "index": true, 
        "similarity": "cosine" 
      }
    }
  }
}

    b. Add demo items in bulk

POST /wardrobe/_bulk
{ "index":{} }
{ "item_name": "Navy Wool Blazer", "category": "Outerwear", "description": "Structured slim-fit blazer, formal, good for cold weather." }
{ "index":{} }
{ "item_name": "White Linen Shirt", "category": "Tops", "description": "Breathable, relaxed fit, perfect for summer and beach events." }
{ "index":{} }
{ "item_name": "Black Chinos", "category": "Bottoms", "description": "Versatile cotton pants, semi-formal, comfortable." }
{ "index":{} }
{ "item_name": "Floral Summer Dress", "category": "Dresses", "description": "Yellow silk with floral patterns, light and airy for outdoors." }
{ "index":{} }
{ "item_name": "Leather Chelsea Boots", "category": "Footwear", "description": "Brown polished leather, ankle height, formal but rugged." }
{ "index":{} }
{ "item_name": "Canvas Sneakers", "category": "Footwear", "description": "White minimalist sneakers, casual, great for walking." }
{ "index":{} }
{ "item_name": "Cashmere Turtleneck", "category": "Tops", "description": "Charcoal grey, very warm, elegant for winter evenings." }

3. Open and Run the Java Application

4. Open and Run the Python file and install python modules if IDE throws errors (streamlit, langchain_openapi, etc.)

5. Run the following streamlit command in terminal: 
    streamlit run /path-to/WardrobeAgent/wardrobeAgent.py

6. Enjoy your very own fashion advisor at http://localhost:8501!